WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:32.416
In this verse, Lord Krishna explains

2
00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:35.500
what a person gains by 
enduring the urges arising

3
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.666
from desire and anger.... 

4
00:00:39.666 --> 00:00:44.333
and how this endurance is
 necessary throughout life..

5
00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:46.416
because these urges are an
 unwanted part of human

6
00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:49.416
material existence....

7
00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:56.583
The person who can endure the urges arising

8
00:00:56.583 --> 00:00:59.416
from desire and anger until the final moments

9
00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:01.500
of life

10
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.208
is the one who achieves true

11
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:05.083
stability in this world.....

12
00:01:05.083 --> 00:01:05.958
and can experience

13
00:01:05.958 --> 00:01:08.458
lasting happiness in this world.....

14
00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:09.833
Lord Krishna elaborates

15
00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:12.375
on this wisdom in this verse....

16
00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:13.708
He uses the word

17
00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:16.250
"shaknoti" in this verse..

18
00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:20.750
which means "to be capable" or "to be able"....

19
00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:22.791
It is possible for a person to endure

20
00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:24.791
with sufficient effort and determination....

21
00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:28.250
all these desires and anger....

22
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:30.916
He tells Arjuna, and through him to all

23
00:01:30.916 --> 00:01:32.750
people....

24
00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:35.250
that humans should endure these impulses

25
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.541
and accept..

26
00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:38.750
that these are merely temporary feelings,

27
00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:42.958
that arise due to one's physical existence....

28
00:01:42.958 --> 00:01:47.791
Lord Krishna's teaching is both
 serious and hopeful.....

29
00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:49.333
Serious because

30
00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:50.875
it tells us that

31
00:01:50.875 --> 00:01:53.083
as long as the body exists,

32
00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:54.291
the struggle with desires

33
00:01:54.291 --> 00:01:56.833
and anger will continue....

34
00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:58.791
And hopeful because.....

35
00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:00.958
it also assures humanity

36
00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:03.708
that this struggle can be controlled

37
00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:07.291
and ultimately conquered.....

38
00:02:07.291 --> 00:02:09.625
To control these impulses,

39
00:02:09.625 --> 00:02:12.083
one must understand their nature

40
00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:15.458
and develop the power to restrain them....

41
00:02:15.458 --> 00:02:16.541
Remember,

42
00:02:16.541 --> 00:02:20.416
these desires and anger are like ocean waves....

43
00:02:20.416 --> 00:02:22.583
They rise and fall.....

44
00:02:22.583 --> 00:02:24.083
They can be powerful....

45
00:02:24.083 --> 00:02:26.375
but they are not permanent.....

46
00:02:26.375 --> 00:02:28.958
If one recognizes this truth

47
00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:32.125
and avoids being swept away by
 the flow of these impulses.....

48
00:02:32.125 --> 00:02:37.166
then one can be freed from 
the distress they cause....

49
00:02:37.166 --> 00:02:39.458
Lord Krishna says, the person who has the ability

50
00:02:39.458 --> 00:02:40.333
to endure their desires

51
00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:43.166
and anger....

52
00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:45.125
is the true yogi....

53
00:02:45.125 --> 00:02:48.208
Lord Krishna calls such a person "yuktah"....

54
00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:51.791
which means "spiritually connected"

55
00:02:51.791 --> 00:02:55.125
and only such people are truly happy....

56
00:02:55.125 --> 00:02:55.833
In this verse,

57
00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:57.458
we also learn

58
00:02:57.458 --> 00:03:00.291
that attaining lasting happiness
 doesn't mean merely

59
00:03:00.291 --> 00:03:02.375
fulfilling desires....

60
00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:04.916
but lies in endurance....

61
00:03:04.916 --> 00:03:07.708
However, "endurance" doesn't just mean

62
00:03:07.708 --> 00:03:08.541
ignoring your desires

63
00:03:08.541 --> 00:03:11.750
and anger..... but

64
00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.375
understanding their temporary nature

65
00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:16.958
and choosing not to act on them....

66
00:03:21.458 --> 00:03:24.250
In life, daily

67
00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:28.208
you face situations

68
00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.458
that test your patience

69
00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:34.166
and self-control.....

70
00:03:34.166 --> 00:03:37.416
Whether it's tension in relationships,

71
00:03:37.416 --> 00:03:40.208
workplace problems.... or

72
00:03:40.208 --> 00:03:43.166
some personal reason,

73
00:03:43.166 --> 00:03:45.541
emotional surges

74
00:03:45.541 --> 00:03:48.458
can be extremely powerful.....

75
00:03:48.458 --> 00:03:53.291
Let's say, as soon as something
 inappropriate happens,

76
00:03:53.291 --> 00:03:57.666
you feel the urge to react immediately....

77
00:03:57.666 --> 00:04:01.375
You get swept away in the flood

78
00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:03.291
of emotions....

79
00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:07.500
But what happens afterwards....?

80
00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.916
When your anger subsides,

81
00:04:11.916 --> 00:04:15.125
only remorse

82
00:04:15.125 --> 00:04:18.750
and regret remains....

83
00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:22.958
For the words spoken, actions taken,

84
00:04:22.958 --> 00:04:27.166
and pain caused to others.....

85
00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:31.333
Along with this, you feel distressed thinking

86
00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:33.958
why you couldn't control

87
00:04:33.958 --> 00:04:37.291
your emotions.....

88
00:04:37.291 --> 00:04:39.416
The momentary satisfaction gained from

89
00:04:39.416 --> 00:04:42.708
expressing anger

90
00:04:42.708 --> 00:04:44.375
quickly

91
00:04:44.375 --> 00:04:47.166
turns into discomfort.....

92
00:04:47.166 --> 00:04:48.583
Knowing

93
00:04:48.583 --> 00:04:50.125
that the situation

94
00:04:50.125 --> 00:04:55.916
could have been handled more calmly..... 
That's why,

95
00:04:55.916 --> 00:04:57.083
I encourage you 

96
00:04:57.083 --> 00:05:02.583
to endure these emotions.....

97
00:05:02.583 --> 00:05:04.125
Anger is

98
00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:06.916
like an itch.....

99
00:05:06.916 --> 00:05:09.958
If we scratch it instead of enduring it,

100
00:05:09.958 --> 00:05:12.500
it only

101
00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:16.500
grows worse.....

102
00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.708
But wait....

103
00:05:18.708 --> 00:05:22.833
Inner peace doesn't lie in reacting to anger....

104
00:05:22.833 --> 00:05:27.583
but in enduring it, rising above it,

105
00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:31.541
and controlling it.....

106
00:05:31.541 --> 00:05:35.083
The more you come under the influence of anger,

107
00:05:35.083 --> 00:05:37.625
the more effective it becomes....

108
00:05:37.625 --> 00:05:39.291
resulting in more anger,

109
00:05:39.291 --> 00:05:42.833
more stress, more suffering.....

110
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:47.166
And that becomes the cause of your regret.....

111
00:05:47.166 --> 00:05:50.583
Therefore, when you're angry,

112
00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:52.833
endure it with peace

113
00:05:52.833 --> 00:05:55.708
and restraint.....

114
00:05:55.708 --> 00:06:00.916
When you don't get trapped in
 the web of your emotions.....

115
00:06:00.916 --> 00:06:02.333
and gain control over your anger

116
00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:06.541
or desires....

117
00:06:06.541 --> 00:06:08.250
then

118
00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:11.166
you become the master

119
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:14.166
of your mind.....!!!

120
00:06:18.666 --> 00:06:21.708
In a family, all members have different

121
00:06:21.708 --> 00:06:25.375
thoughts and desires....

122
00:06:25.375 --> 00:06:29.291
and this very diversity 
sometimes creates tension,

123
00:06:29.291 --> 00:06:32.875
disagreement, or anger

124
00:06:32.875 --> 00:06:35.500
in the family....

125
00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.750
Actually,

126
00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:40.083
it's natural for such situations to arise....

127
00:06:40.083 --> 00:06:43.458
but in such circumstances

128
00:06:43.458 --> 00:06:47.333
what will be your reaction?

129
00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:50.375
Because this is the moment

130
00:06:50.375 --> 00:06:52.083
when your understanding

131
00:06:52.083 --> 00:06:55.416
and patience are tested.

132
00:06:55.416 --> 00:06:57.708
In such situations, when

133
00:06:57.708 --> 00:07:02.000
you control your impulses....

134
00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.333
you not only prevent 
relationships from breaking,

135
00:07:05.333 --> 00:07:06.250
but

136
00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:10.541
they become even stronger and purer....

137
00:07:10.541 --> 00:07:12.625
Imagine,

138
00:07:12.625 --> 00:07:15.375
someone in your family

139
00:07:15.375 --> 00:07:19.625
said something that hurt your feelings....

140
00:07:19.625 --> 00:07:22.666
It's natural for you to feel angry 
in such a situation.....

141
00:07:22.666 --> 00:07:27.375
Perhaps even to respond back!!

142
00:07:27.375 --> 00:07:29.625
And what will happen

143
00:07:29.625 --> 00:07:33.083
if you did so?

144
00:07:33.083 --> 00:07:35.375
By getting angry at that member

145
00:07:35.375 --> 00:07:38.500
or responding back,

146
00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.125
you might certainly gain

147
00:07:41.125 --> 00:07:43.000
momentary satisfaction.

148
00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:48.083
But it might create more tension in relationships

149
00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:53.250
or become the reason for 
their breakdown in the future!!!

150
00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:56.208
On the other hand,

151
00:07:56.208 --> 00:08:00.208
if you remain patient and restrained....

152
00:08:00.208 --> 00:08:03.166
and in that situation, before giving

153
00:08:03.166 --> 00:08:04.541
any reaction

154
00:08:04.541 --> 00:08:09.083
allow that surge of anger to calm

155
00:08:09.083 --> 00:08:11.666
then this very patience will save the relationship

156
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:15.416
from breaking..... And establish love

157
00:08:15.416 --> 00:08:18.458
and mutual harmony in the family....

158
00:08:18.458 --> 00:08:22.375
Similarly, in social life too, handle

159
00:08:22.375 --> 00:08:25.500
every situation with patience

160
00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:28.375
and calmness....

161
00:08:28.375 --> 00:08:35.791
This patience is the path to happiness
 and peace in your family and social life....

162
00:08:40.333 --> 00:08:42.750
Perhaps this question has also arisen

163
00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.666
in your mind:

164
00:08:45.666 --> 00:08:49.291
in an organization where each person

165
00:08:49.291 --> 00:08:51.083
brings different perspectives

166
00:08:51.083 --> 00:08:53.625
and ideas,

167
00:08:53.625 --> 00:08:58.666
how can balance and harmony be maintained?

168
00:08:58.666 --> 00:09:02.708
What if everyone's disagreement

169
00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:06.250
or anger is responded to?

170
00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:09.666
While working in an organization
 in professional life....

171
00:09:09.666 --> 00:09:12.916
situations of disagreement, dissent,

172
00:09:12.916 --> 00:09:14.583
and tension

173
00:09:14.583 --> 00:09:16.791
may arise.

174
00:09:16.791 --> 00:09:22.333
If care is not taken in handling these situations,

175
00:09:22.333 --> 00:09:26.583
they can also become causes of conflict....

176
00:09:26.583 --> 00:09:29.375
In such situations, patience is what

177
00:09:29.375 --> 00:09:31.791
holds the organization together.

178
00:09:31.791 --> 00:09:33.125
Naturally..

179
00:09:33.125 --> 00:09:34.791
when members of an organization

180
00:09:34.791 --> 00:09:38.125
work together, different

181
00:09:38.125 --> 00:09:41.375
perspectives and ideas come forward....

182
00:09:41.375 --> 00:09:45.125
and these become causes of disagreement.

183
00:09:45.125 --> 00:09:46.250
If you react immediately

184
00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.750
at such times,

185
00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.625
it will create tension in the organization

186
00:09:51.625 --> 00:09:52.708
and perhaps

187
00:09:52.708 --> 00:09:56.375
even cause the organization to break apart.

188
00:09:56.375 --> 00:09:59.375
Now, imagine

189
00:09:59.375 --> 00:10:02.875
you are in an organization....

190
00:10:02.875 --> 00:10:06.458
where every member is patient.

191
00:10:06.458 --> 00:10:08.500
Whenever any disagreement

192
00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:11.791
or disappointment arises, they don't

193
00:10:11.791 --> 00:10:12.833
react immediately,

194
00:10:12.833 --> 00:10:17.083
but remain calm in that moment

195
00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:18.791
and instead of arguments,

196
00:10:18.791 --> 00:10:22.750
they take steps towards
 understanding each other.

197
00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.291
This nature not only eliminates tension

198
00:10:25.291 --> 00:10:28.416
and disagreements.... but

199
00:10:28.416 --> 00:10:31.500
increases mutual harmony and trust....

200
00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:35.291
which leads the organization in
 the direction of success....

201
00:10:35.291 --> 00:10:36.125
An organization

202
00:10:36.125 --> 00:10:39.250
that adopts the principle of patience,

203
00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:41.375
works with love, trust,

204
00:10:41.375 --> 00:10:44.375
and unity.

205
00:10:44.375 --> 00:10:47.333
If disagreements in professional life

206
00:10:47.333 --> 00:10:50.416
are handled with patience

207
00:10:50.416 --> 00:10:52.541
and conflicts are resolved

208
00:10:52.541 --> 00:10:54.750
constructively,

209
00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:57.250
then a feeling of unity

210
00:10:57.250 --> 00:11:00.583
and trust awakens in the organization

211
00:11:00.583 --> 00:11:04.958
and the organization begins to
 move on the path of success!!!
